      en: ["The park was inscribed as a UNESCO World Heritage site in 2001.", "The total area of the national park is approximately 711 square kilometers.", "About 70% of the plant species found here are endemic to Cuba.", "It is home to the Monte Iberia frog, one of the smallest in the world.", "The park is named after the polymath naturalist Alexander von Humboldt.", "The highest elevation within the park reaches roughly 1,175 meters."],
